{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"Eilenberg–MacLane 谱"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Eilenberg–MacLane谱"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>对于 Abel 群 $A$, 其 Eilenberg–MacLane 谱 $HA$ 为表示 $A$-系数上同调的谱.</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"连合谱","text":"连合谱"}},{"Plain":"等同于 "},{"Local":{"url":"Abel∞-群","text":"Abel ∞-群"}},{"Plain":", 在此对应下 $HA$ 对应 Abel 群 $A$ 自身.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"t-结构","text":"t-结构"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}